    "description": {
      "content": "The Backstage Search API provides endpoints for querying the Backstage search index. It enables full-text search across all indexed content including catalog entities, TechDocs pages, and any other content indexed by search collators. The API supports filtering by document type, pagination via cursors, and term-based queries.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Backstage",
